project ADR0006:
  version 1
  title "UUID-stable mv and identity-linked masks"
  description |
    ADR 0006を実装issue #161から#169まで順番に進める。
    各taskはfocused regression、設計整合性review、non-WIP commit、
    issueへの結果記録とcloseまでを完了条件に含む。
    task=edge、milestone=nodeとし、後段は前段の受け入れ完了まで開始しない。
  as_of 2026-07-23
  duration_unit point
  velocity 5p/1d
  finish ADR0006_ACCEPTED

resource CODEX:
  title "実装担当枠"
  capacity 1

resource REVIEW:
  title "設計整合性レビュー枠"
  capacity 1

milestone NOW:
  title "計画コミット完了"
  state reached

milestone MASK_MODEL_OBSERVABLE:
  title "mask read modelを外部観測可能"

milestone MASK_INSPECTION_ACCEPTED:
  title "mask inspectionとmigration dry-run受け入れ完了"

milestone MASK_WRITES_ACCEPTED:
  title "canonical mask writeとchain操作受け入れ完了"

milestone MASK_IMPACT_ACCEPTED:
  title "mutation impactと警告契約受け入れ完了"

milestone LOCAL_MV_ACCEPTED:
  title "local UUID-stable mv受け入れ完了"

milestone SOURCE_ABSENCE_ACCEPTED:
  title "source-effective absence受け入れ完了"

milestone INHERITED_MV_ACCEPTED:
  title "inherited mvとpropagate受け入れ完了"

milestone CROSS_NAMESPACE_ACCEPTED:
  title "cross-domain/store mv受け入れ完了"

milestone ADR0006_ACCEPTED:
  title "全surfaceと全体回帰受け入れ完了"

task MASK_READ_MODEL NOW -> MASK_MODEL_OBSERVABLE:
  title "canonical mask read modelとimpact classifierを実装する"
  description |
    Issue #161。canonical/legacy parser、entry_id到達性、state分類、
    共通impact analyzer、最小のlist --all-masks --json観測面、
    tests/mask_identity_regression.shを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 5p
  status done
  priority 90
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task MASK_INSPECTION MASK_MODEL_OBSERVABLE -> MASK_INSPECTION_ACCEPTED:
  title "mask inspectionとmigration dry-runを完成する"
  description |
    Issue #162。dormant/orphaned/all-masks filter、long/JSON認可、
    fsck分類、rollback-safe migration dry-runを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 5p
  status done
  priority 80
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task MASK_WRITES MASK_INSPECTION_ACCEPTED -> MASK_WRITES_ACCEPTED:
  title "transaction基盤とrollback-safe canonical mask writeを実装する"
  description |
    Issue #163。operation plan/snapshot、journal/staged commit/recoveryを先に作り、
    legacy dual-write、rebind、fallback chain、chain-aware unmask、
    mask系dry-run/JSONと対応help/spec/man/completion/poを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 13p
  status active
  priority 70
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task MASK_IMPACT_WRITES MASK_WRITES_ACCEPTED -> MASK_IMPACT_ACCEPTED:
  title "全mutationにmask impactと直交警告を適用する"
  description |
    Issue #164。set/cp/ln/rm/load/multi-setのpreserve/reject、
    default/on/off警告、direct-hit、whole-batch transaction、
    dry-run/JSONと対応help/spec/man/completion/poを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 21p
  status planned
  priority 60
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task LOCAL_UUID_MV MASK_IMPACT_ACCEPTED -> LOCAL_MV_ACCEPTED:
  title "same-domain/store UUID-stable v2 mvを実装する"
  description |
    Issue #165。entry_id/secret_idを維持するentry rename、
    descendant maskのlast-known更新とinaccessible preflight、metadata移動、
    link/refcount不変、journal recovery、dry-run/JSON、
    対応help/spec/man/completion/poを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 13p
  status planned
  priority 50
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task SOURCE_ABSENCE LOCAL_MV_ACCEPTED -> SOURCE_ABSENCE_ACCEPTED:
  title "local override move後のsource absenceを保存する"
  description |
    Issue #166。source-mask-created、preserve/reject planning、
    inherited fallback非露出、dry-run/JSON、
    対応help/spec/man/completion/poを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 8p
  status planned
  priority 40
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task INHERITED_MV SOURCE_ABSENCE_ACCEPTED -> INHERITED_MV_ACCEPTED:
  title "inherited-source mvとmask propagateを実装する"
  description |
    Issue #167。新entry_idと同一secret_idのmaterialize、
    source mask、registered descendant preflight、propagate、dry-run/JSON、
    対応help/spec/man/completion/poを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 21p
  status planned
  priority 30
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task CROSS_NAMESPACE_MV INHERITED_MV_ACCEPTED -> CROSS_NAMESPACE_ACCEPTED:
  title "guarded cross-domain/store v2 mvを実装する"
  description |
    Issue #168。object-owner lifecycle guard、rewrap、既存journalの
    cross-domain recovery、changed-since-plan、dry-run/JSON、fault regression、
    対応help/spec/man/completion/poを実装・review・commitする。
  duration 34p
  status planned
  priority 20
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1

task SURFACE_COMPLETION CROSS_NAMESPACE_ACCEPTED -> ADR0006_ACCEPTED:
  title "SDK FUSE migrationと全surface整合性監査を完成する"
  description |
    Issue #169。versioned SDK impact API、FUSE audit、migration finalization、
    各sliceで更新済みのhelp/spec/man/README/completion/poを最終監査し、
    optional FUSE buildとmake checkを完了してreview・commitする。
  duration 21p
  status planned
  priority 10
  requires:
    CODEX 1
    REVIEW 1
